        }
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-05-19",
      "dateModified": "2026-05-19",
      "inLanguage": "hi-IN",
      "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/plots-kanpur-road-hindi-lucknow-2026"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kanpur Road Lucknow par plot ki keemat 2026 mein kya hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Kanpur Road par plot ki keemat zone aur legal status par nirbhar karti hai. Zone A (Sarojini Nagar / Amausi airport belt) mein approved plot Rs 1700-4500 per sqft, Zone B (Banthra corridor) gated society plot Rs 850-2000 per sqft, aur Zone C (Banthara / Natkur frontier) mein approved plot Rs 900-1300 per sqft milte hain."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Kanpur Road plot investment ke liye sahi hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Haan, khaas taur par Zone B (Banthra / Bani) 3-5 saal ke investors ke liye aur Zone A rental income ke liye behtar hai. Awadh Expressway (NE-6) jald shuru hone wala hai aur iska elevated section Zone B se hokar guzarta hai."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Awadh Expressway kya hai aur ye Kanpur Road plots par kaisa asar dalega?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Awadh Expressway (National Expressway 6) 63 km lambi 6-lane expressway hai jo NH-27 ke parallel Lucknow se Kanpur tak jaati hai. May 2026 tak Lucknow package ke ramps aur toll plazas ka kaam baki hai. Iska elevated section Amausi se Bani tak Zone B se hokar jaata hai."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kanpur Road ka sabse sasta legal plot kaunsa hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Sabse sasta legal aur bank-loan eligible plot Banthra Sikander Pur ki gated societies mein milta hai — lagbhag Rs 8.5 lakh mein 1000 sqft (Rs 850 per sqft). Is se kam keemat par plot mile to woh almost certainly unapproved ya agricultural land hoga."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Sarojini Nagar Kanpur Road par invest karna sahi hai kya?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Haan — un buyers ke liye jo airport proximity, metro connectivity aur defence corridor rental demand chahte hain. CCS International Airport isi zone mein hai. Eldeco Imperia (RERA: UPRERAPRJ929056) aur Eldeco East End (RERA: UPRERAPRJ513776) yahaan ke pramukh RERA-registered branded project hain."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Awadh Expressway ke paas plot lene mein kya risks hain?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Teen mukhya risks hain: (1) Agricultural land ko expressway-adjacent investment plot bana kar bechna — Krishi-classified zameen ko expressway touch plot bata kar bechte hain. Khatauni upbhulekh.gov.in par check karein. (2) Banthra aur Banthara mein unapproved colonies — koi LDA ya UPRERA clearance nahi. (3) Nagar Panchayat jurisdiction wale plot ko LDA-approved batana — verify karein ki kaunsi approval category hai."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Kanpur Road plot par home loan mil sakta hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Haan — RERA-registered projects jaise Eldeco Imperia aur Eldeco East End ke liye sabhi major banks plot loan dete hain. Nagar Panchayat area ki gated societies ke liye bank financing project aur lender par nirbhar karti hai — payment se pehle apne bank se confirm karein. Unapproved aur agricultural plot par koi bhi bank loan nahi deta."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
